Step 6: Understanding Recovery Points

A major focus of the module was recovery points.

A recovery point represents a recoverable backup snapshot.

Example:
Monday Backup
Tuesday Backup
Wednesday Backup
Thursday Backup

If data is lost Thursday:

Restore Wednesday Recovery Point
Benefits:
Point-in-time recovery
Multiple restore options
Reduced data loss
Key lesson learned:

Recovery points are what make restoration possible.

